  "limits": "2D cameras only; it writes Camera2D.offset and rotation, so another script writing them at the same time fights it. Noise values are clamped to -1..1; FastNoiseLite simplex output rarely reaches the ends, so the full offset is seldom reached. The motion repeats for a seed on this engine build; the noise library may differ between engine versions. Verified with Godot 4.7.2 headless; written against the Godot 4.3 API.",
